IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpf-allocation`
IMPORT `cpf-exemption`

-- Central Provident Fund -- allocation to the accounts (CPF Board publication, from 1 January 2026) and the Central Provident
-- Fund (Exemption) Order 2018 (version as made). Expected results written by hand. Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING
-- on stated facts, not about the law.

§ `REQ-0002 (cradle-to-grave-simone e041)`

-- $1,554 for a member aged 23: medisave 0.2162 x 1,554 = 335.9748 -> $335.97; special 0.1621 x 1,554 = 251.9034 -> $251.90;
-- ordinary account the remainder, $966.13. (The ledger expected OA 966, SA 252, MA 336: the same split, rounded to dollars.)
#ASSERT `the medisave credit` 23 1554 EQUALS 335.97
#ASSERT `the special or retirement account credit` 23 1554 EQUALS 251.9
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 23 1554 EQUALS 966.13
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit for wages` 23 4200 2026 EQUALS 966.13

§ `The publication's worked examples`

#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 30 100 EQUALS 62.17
#ASSERT `the special or retirement account credit` 30 100 EQUALS 16.21
#ASSERT `the medisave credit` 30 100 EQUALS 21.62
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 57 100 EQUALS 35.3
#ASSERT `the special or retirement account credit` 57 100 EQUALS 33.82
#ASSERT `the medisave credit` 57 100 EQUALS 30.88

§ `Other bands`

#ASSERT `the medisave credit` 40 1000 EQUALS 243.2
#ASSERT `the special or retirement account credit` 40 1000 EQUALS 189.1
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 40 1000 EQUALS 567.7
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 35 1000 EQUALS 621.7
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 36 1000 EQUALS 567.7
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 50 1000 EQUALS 513.6
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 55 1000 EQUALS 405.5
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 62 1000 EQUALS 140
#ASSERT `the medisave credit` 68 500 EQUALS 318.15
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 68 500 EQUALS 30.35
#ASSERT `the medisave credit` 72 375 EQUALS 315
#ASSERT `the ordinary account credit` 72 375 EQUALS 30

§ `Fixtures for the Exemption Order`

GIVEN i IS A Institution, approved IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Student
`a student of` i approved MEANS
    Student WITH
        `institution` IS i
        `matriculated or registered` IS TRUE
        `employed for training approved by the institution` IS approved
        `in a full-time MOE-subsidised programme listed on the MOE website` IS FALSE
        `required by the institution to train in Singapore for months` IS 0
        `gave the employer the institution's written confirmation` IS FALSE
        `has completed the GCE A Level or equivalent` IS FALSE
        `employed during a school holiday period` IS FALSE

GIVEN months IS A NUMBER, confirmed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Student
`an overseas student training here for` months confirmed MEANS
    Student WITH
        `institution` IS `an overseas tertiary education institution`
        `matriculated or registered` IS TRUE
        `employed for training approved by the institution` IS TRUE
        `in a full-time MOE-subsidised programme listed on the MOE website` IS FALSE
        `required by the institution to train in Singapore for months` IS months
        `gave the employer the institution's written confirmation` IS confirmed
        `has completed the GCE A Level or equivalent` IS FALSE
        `employed during a school holiday period` IS FALSE

GIVEN `done A levels` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Student
`a holiday job for a school pupil` `done A levels` MEANS
    Student WITH
        `institution` IS `a school listed in paragraph 8`
        `matriculated or registered` IS TRUE
        `employed for training approved by the institution` IS FALSE
        `in a full-time MOE-subsidised programme listed on the MOE website` IS FALSE
        `required by the institution to train in Singapore for months` IS 0
        `gave the employer the institution's written confirmation` IS FALSE
        `has completed the GCE A Level or equivalent` IS `done A levels`
        `employed during a school holiday period` IS TRUE

GIVETH A Student
`not a student` MEANS `a student of` `none of these` FALSE

§ `REQ-0003 (cradle-to-grave-simone e032)`

-- A citizen aged 22, a matriculated NUS student (a university whose function is determined by written law), on a paid
-- internship of $1,200 a month in May 2025 that is part of her course, so training approved by the university: Schedule
-- para 5(a), so no contributions are payable. If the internship were not training approved by the university, they would be.
#ASSERT `CPF contributions are payable on the wages` TRUE (`a student of` `a university whose function is determined by written law` TRUE) `none of the others` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `CPF contributions are payable on the wages` TRUE (`a student of` `a university whose function is determined by written law` FALSE) `none of the others` EQUALS TRUE

§ `Schedule paragraphs 5 to 8 -- other students`

#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`a student of` `a polytechnic established by written law` TRUE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`a student of` `the Institute of Technical Education` TRUE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`a student of` `a private education institution` TRUE) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`an overseas student training here for` 6 TRUE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`an overseas student training here for` 7 TRUE) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`an overseas student training here for` 3 FALSE) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`a holiday job for a school pupil` FALSE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `is a specified student employee` (`a holiday job for a school pupil` TRUE) EQUALS FALSE

§ `Paragraphs 3 and the rest of the Schedule`

#ASSERT `the employer is exempt from section 7 contributions` FALSE `not a student` `none of the others` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the employer is exempt from section 7 contributions` TRUE `not a student` `a domestic employee working at most 14 hours a week` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the employer is exempt from section 7 contributions` TRUE `not a student` `none of the others` EQUALS FALSE
